# Empire PZ mods repo — track ONLY our custom mod folders.
# Ignore everything at top level...
/*
# ...then re-include just our stuff:
!/.gitignore
!/Empire*/
# docs hold no mod.info, so the game ignores the folder when this repo sits in mods/
!/docs/

# ...but the EmpireLean.txt preset + its backups are config, not code:
EmpireLean.txt
EmpireLean.txt.*

# editor/OS noise inside mod folders
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp
!/README.md
